caption: The Shared Truth
tradition-component: the-shared-truth

The Revelator trains a conjunction as one psychic phenomenon. A Shared Technique is a Psi Technique or Temporary Enhancement that applies the same legal enhancement or other approved Power-Technique change to at least two components of one purchased Conjunction Ability.

Determine legality separately for every affected component. Calculate the modifier value applied to each component, add those values together, and derive the stunt penalty from the total under the normal Psi Technique or Temporary Enhancement rules. Pay the normal technique cost once. Make one technique roll using the worst effective target number among the affected components. On success, every affected component receives the change for that use. On failure, none do.

A Shared Technique may be bought as one Hard technique. Its effective level can never exceed the lowest current effective level among the component ability skills or other governing rolls it modifies. Normal restrictions on Power Techniques and Psi Techniques remain in force; Shared Truth does not make an enhancement legal for a component that could not normally take it.

At Mastery, Shared Truth becomes Origin-facing. A Shared Technique may include compatible components governed by any Psi or Super Power Talents the character legitimately possesses, provided those components are all part of the same purchased Revelator Conjunction. For this cross-Origin use, apply the Shared Technique procedure above to the entire affected package. This is permission to train the interaction, not general permission to apply Psi Techniques to unrelated Super abilities.
